// Q16 (i): four exams whose conflicts form a path, two batches. Feasible (a path is 2-colourable).
// 1-path.exam solved by quantum annealing (D-Wave QPU) instead: keep the problems identical.
// Needs DWAVE_API_TOKEN at run time; without it, run_generated copies recorded/quantum_annealing/ (ADR-0010).
problem path_quantum_annealing batches 2
students Ana Rui Eva
exam Algebra   weight 2 { Ana }
exam Calculus  weight 3 { Ana Rui }
exam Physics   weight 1 { Rui Eva }
exam Chemistry weight 2 { Eva }

solver { method quantum_annealing sampler qpu reads 500 annealing_time 200 seed 7 }
